{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達前行政總裁黃仁勳因醜聞遭罷免後，公司股價大幅下挫，讓做空者獲得數百億美元的賬面收益。S3 Partners數據顯示，英偉達股價較10月6日創下的歷史高點下跌35%，做空這家晶片製造商的交易員估計獲得了240億美元的賬面利潤。英偉達周一再跌4.1%，此前一周的跌幅創下美國總統當勞·特朗普2025年4月宣佈關税措施以來最大。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586716.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.956061+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:10:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"4039cdc6a641edd0cfd5bb65590eab9387aeec64d09b805476c78ac82704211c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}